# Plain-field living-area rug (issue 166): one fern green with a leaf border and a thin cream line, fringe on the short ends. Seen from above like the floor: flat, ink outline, palette only, no print or text. 8x4 tiles. Lies on the floor under the furniture and the player.
size: 128x64
